00:16:07.319 --> 00:16:08.319
I'd love it if she did.

00:16:08.319 --> 00:16:13.339
I think it would be really fun, but it just
doesn't seem like the kind of thing prestige

00:16:13.339 --> 00:16:15.759
actor, Natalie Portman, would do.

00:16:15.759 --> 00:16:17.920
I think we're a one and done situation.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:21.549
I agree, but she also hasn't been like doing
a ton of stuff lately.

00:16:21.549 --> 00:16:22.799
That's true.

00:16:22.799 --> 00:16:25.680
This might be the comeback that she was waiting
for.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:27.100
Come back, like she needed a comeback.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.100
Yeah.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.100
She's Natalie frigging Portman.

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:30.100
She's just ever-present.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.100
Yeah.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:32.319
Yeah.

00:16:32.319 --> 00:16:34.139
So yeah, those are my picks.

00:16:34.139 --> 00:16:35.779
That's what I think will happen.

00:16:35.779 --> 00:16:40.709
So we'll come back in a few years, assuming
that we're still doing this a few years from

00:16:40.709 --> 00:16:44.429
now, at the end of phase four, and we'll see
which one of us was right and which one of

00:16:44.429 --> 00:16:45.429
us was wrong.

00:16:45.429 --> 00:16:46.720
I bet all of us were right.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:47.720
We're all right.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:48.720
Every single one we said.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:49.720
I'll still be doing this.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:50.720
I don't know about you guys.

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:51.720
Yeah.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.720
And also you can see all of us in Knives Out
2.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.399
We're both going to be movie stars.

00:16:54.399 --> 00:16:55.399
